# build/catalog.json, build/meshes/, build/fixtures/ and build/parity-expected.json
# ARE committed on purpose. They are small, deterministic and byte-stable, and
# they are the product's primary interface: an agent handed this repository can
# read the contract immediately without running anything. Regenerate with
# `./tessera build`; a diff there is meaningful, not noise.
